  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Tab: Basic Profile (Personal Information)",
      "id": "personal-information",
      "intro": "Tab **Basic Profile** adalah halaman pertama yang tampil saat membuka Personal Setting. Di sini pengguna dapat mengelola foto profil (upload, crop, hapus) serta mengubah Display Name dan Email Address. Field System Role dan Username bersifat read-only dan tidak dapat diubah.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Seksi Foto Profil",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Avatar Display**: Menampilkan foto profil aktif (jika ada) atau avatar inisial bergradient jika belum ada foto. Foto dibungkus lingkaran dengan cincin gradien biru.\n• **Tombol Upload New**: Membuka dialog file picker untuk memilih gambar baru. Format yang didukung: JPG, PNG, WEBP. Ukuran maksimal: **5 MB**.\n• **Tombol Edit Crop**: Hanya muncul jika ada foto baru yang sudah di-crop namun belum disimpan. Membuka kembali modal Crop & Adjust Photo.\n• **Tombol Remove**: Hanya tampil jika ada foto (tersimpan atau preview). Langsung menghapus foto dari server dan me-refresh data pengguna tanpa perlu klik Save Changes.\n• **Badge Unsaved (!)**: Muncul di pojok kiri atas avatar jika ada foto baru yang sudah di-crop tapi belum di-upload ke server (menunggu klik Save Changes).",
          "color": "#1e40af",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:10px;\">Profile Photo</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;flex-shrink:0;\"><div style=\"padding:4px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#1e40af);\"><div style=\"width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#1e40af);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:3px solid #fff;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;\">JD</span></div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:4px;right:4px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;border:2px solid #fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:-2px;right:-2px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ef4444);border:2px solid #fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;\">!</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:3px;\">Profile Picture</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:8px;\">Upload a professional photo. JPG, PNG, WEBP. Max 5MB.</div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(251,191,36,.12);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.35);margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">⚠️ Unsaved Changes — Click \"Save Changes\" to upload.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">↑ Upload New</button><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;border:none;color:#1e40af;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">✂ Edit Crop</button><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fee2e2;border:none;color:#dc2626;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">✕ Remove</button></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Modal Crop & Adjust Photo",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nSetelah memilih file gambar, modal **Crop & Adjust Photo** akan muncul secara otomatis:\n• **Crop Area**: Area interaktif 380px untuk mengatur posisi foto dengan drag, scroll (zoom), dan rotasi.\n• **Crop Shape**: Pilih bentuk crop — **Circle** (lingkaran, rasio 1:1) untuk avatar, atau **Rectangle** (4:3) untuk foto persegi.\n• **Zoom Slider**: Kontrol perbesaran dari 1x hingga 3x (step 0.1).\n• **Rotation Slider**: Putar gambar dari 0° hingga 360° (step 1°). Ada tombol reset `↺` untuk mengembalikan ke 0°.\n• **Apply Crop**: Klik untuk memproses crop. Hasil akan tampil sebagai preview di halaman utama (belum di-upload sampai Save Changes diklik).",
          "color": "#2563eb",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#dbeafe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e40af\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Crop & Adjust Photo</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Customize your profile picture</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px;\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:100px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f3f5;border:2px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:8px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:50%;border:2px dashed #2563eb;background:rgba(37,99,235,.08);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#2563eb;\">JD</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:5px;\">Crop Shape</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:4px;border-radius:5px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">⬤ Circle</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:4px;border-radius:5px;background:#dbeafe;border:none;color:#1e40af;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">▬ Rectangle</button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;padding:7px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Zoom  <span style=\"color:#94a3b8;\">1.5x</span></div><div style=\"height:3px;border-radius:99px;background:#e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"width:40%;height:3px;border-radius:99px;background:#2563eb;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:7px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Rotation  <span style=\"color:#94a3b8;\">0°</span></div><div style=\"height:3px;border-radius:99px;background:#e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"width:0%;height:3px;border-radius:99px;background:#2563eb;\"></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">✓ Apply Crop</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Seksi Edit Profile & Field Informasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\nBagian **Edit Profile** berisi 4 field dalam grid 2 kolom:\n1. **Display Name** *(Editable)*: Nama yang ditampilkan di profil dan dashboard. Diawali dengan icon `User`.\n2. **Email Address** *(Editable)*: Email utama untuk kontak dan login. Diawali dengan icon `@`.\n3. **System Role** *(Read-Only)*: Level otorisasi pengguna (misal `Admin`, `User`). Field dinonaktifkan, tidak dapat diubah.\n4. **Username** *(Read-Only)*: Username login unik. Field dinonaktifkan, tidak dapat diubah.\n\n> Setiap perubahan pada field editable akan mengaktifkan state `dirty`, sehingga tombol **Save Changes** dan **Discard** di footer menjadi aktif.",
          "color": "#1e40af",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "3": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(30,64,175,.1);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;padding:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;color:#2563eb;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:10px;\">Edit Profile</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:3px;\">Display Name</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #2563eb;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#0f172a;\">John Doe</span></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:3px;\">Email Address</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #2563eb;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#0f172a;\">john@company.com</span></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:3px;\">System Role</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;opacity:.7;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">Admin</span></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:3px;\">Username</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;opacity:.7;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#94a3b8;\">johndoe</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;opacity:.5;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;\">Changes are saved securely</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#64748b;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">Discard</button><button style=\"padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">Save Changes</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
